phases.prompt:
Open a pull request for this work.

Ticket:

${ticket}

Brief:

${brief}

The engineer's note:

${change}

Final review and QA decision:

${verdict}

The change is committed on branch ${worktrees.repo.branch} in your current directory (a worktree of the repository). Push it with `git push -u origin ${worktrees.repo.branch}`, then open the PR with `gh pr create` against the repository's default branch. Title: the ticket key and summary. Body: what changed, how it was validated (quote the QA evidence), the assumptions from the brief, and a link to the ticket (its Link line).

If the decision above ends with `DECISION: FIX`, open it as a draft (`--draft`) and list the outstanding items at the top of the body.

Return the PR URL.

